{"id":"mdip","name":"MDIP","form":"capsule","status":"Reference","source":"Wikidata","wikidata":"Q4634076","aliases":"","category":"Empathogen","chemicalClass":"Substituted phenethylamines","groups":[],"atc":[],"summary":"MDIP, also known as 3,4-methylenedioxy-N-isopropylamphetamine or as N-isopropyl-MDA, is a psychoactive drug of the phenethylamine and amphetamine families. It is the N-isopropyl analogue of 3,4-methylenedioxyamphetamine (MDA).","summarySources":"Wikipedia","doseUnit":"","doseRows":[],"durationRows":[],"subjectiveEffects":[],"combinations":[],"citations":[],"helpfulLinks":[{"title":"Wikipedia","description":"Encyclopedia article","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/3%2C4-Methylenedioxy-N-isopropylamphetamine"},{"title":"Wikidata","description":"Structured data on MDIP","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q4634076"},{"title":"PubChem","description":"Chemistry, safety and literature","url":"https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/3057996"},{"title":"維基百科","description":"zh:Encyclopedia article","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-tw/3%2C4-%E4%BA%9A%E7%94%B2%E4%BA%8C%E6%B0%A7%E5%9F%BA-N-%E5%BC%82%E4%B8%99%E5%9F%BA%E8%8B%AF%E4%B8%99%E8%83%BA"}],"formula":"C13H19NO2","molarMass":221.29,"uses":{"routes":"Oral","figures":"3,4-Methylenedioxy-N-isopropylamphetamine"},"summaryZh":"3,4-亞甲二氧基-N-異丙基苯丙胺（簡稱MDIP、MDIPA）是苯乙胺和苯丙胺化學類別的精神藥物，可作為誘因、迷幻劑和興奮劑。它是3,4-亞甲二氧基苯丙胺的N-異丙基類似物。MDIP最早由亞歷山大·舒爾金合成。在他的書《PiHKAL》中，最小劑量被列為250毫克。MDIP產生一個溫和的閾值。"}